Indonesian village and district corpora

The villages and districts, their names, their district, regency and province
names and the expected points and ISO 3166-2 codes in
tests/gold.id-villages.seeds.jsonl, tests/gold.id-villages.jsonl,
tests/gold.id-districts.seeds.jsonl and tests/gold.id-districts.jsonl come from
Wikidata (CC0 1.0, https://www.wikidata.org/), as recorded per case.

Villages and districts were vetted against, and each case's tolerance derived
from the village and district areas of, the Indonesia Subnational Administrative Boundaries (COD-AB) published
by OCHA on the Humanitarian Data Exchange
(https://data.humdata.org/dataset/cod-ab-idn), compiled from Badan Pusat
Statistik (BPS - Statistics Indonesia), licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 3.0 IGO licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/igo/).
No boundary or name from it is redistributed here. The file used and its SHA-256
are recorded in tests/id-villages/manifest.json and
tests/id-villages/districts.manifest.json.
